# Stage-1 attract demo rendered from the NATIVE WORLD RUNTIME (game::World): every model draw (level sections, sky, rain,
# props, enemies, civilian, effects, player shot flashes) and the camera come from the simulation, which starts at the
# stage start (frame 2786) and is verified frame by frame against the original (tests/world_test.cpp).
# 65574 = the task serial counter at the stage start in the reference run (history-dependent).
world 0 2786 65574
# Environment from the stage script (same as st1_demo_cam42.scene) and the PRESS START overlay (traced, boot frame counter).
env st1evtbl.bin 0x0097A208 0x0097A28C
overlay press_start phase 1
